Next acceptance targets

• Rematch/refresh browser verification now passes: a further Solo match finished after 19 driver actions, then rematch →
    refresh restored the active game with one canvas. The reconnect token is saved again when a seated player enters
    active play; the repeatable script returns only its presence. Keep this acceptance check through later connection
    changes.

• Complete interaction/visual polish for multi-card masses and all seat counts; extract lobby/results/HUD from
    GameBoard and measure loading/frame budgets on real mobile devices.

• Resolve the remaining high dependency advisories through deliberate watcher/protocol upgrades, retaining network
    regression coverage.

• Exercise production-shaped containers, MongoDB result writes, Redis scale-out and external Discord
    OAuth/embedding. Validate native builds separately.

